WEBVTT

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.660
Arte!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.660
Hey!

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.750
Angelo!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.790
Are you here for the funeral, too?

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.200
Yes, but I'm just here to accompany Leo.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.790
Me, too.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.700
He was a master in the guild,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.540
but I just saw him around
and never interacted with him.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.330
I wonder if that's true
for all the apprentices here.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:00.160
Probably. It was a sudden funeral,

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.370
so I think everyone just came along
without knowing what was going on.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.080
Well, that was sudden.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:10.580
Yeah, it was probably unexpected
for the family, too.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:14.790
The problem is what to do with the
apprentices and family he left behind.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:19.040
We'll just have to divide the
burden up amongst ourselves.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.080
Florence at the beginning of the 16th century--

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:28.790
At the time, trade guilds bound together
masters of the same profession,

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:34.700
and they had a duty to help each other
financially and with things like funerals.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.000
Leo. Right, I heard you took on
an apprentice recently?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.250
How about it? Do you want
to take on another one?

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:46.410
My workshop is small, so I don't
plan on taking on anyone else...

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:47.580
I see...

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.790
Well, you usually work alone, anyway, right?

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:55.540
I'm sorry. I plan to give financially
as much as I can.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.040
Oh, really? That'll be a big help.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:03.410
I feel like for the past few years,
I've participated in more of these than before.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:07.330
Yeah, it's probably because Florence
has been in a slump lately.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.000
Everyone's having a hard time.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.330
Go!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:49.750
"Trade Guild"

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.700
Everyone's so free they've
started playing <i>calcio</i> .

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.700
Is it really okay even though
we're at a funeral service?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.870
Oh, it's Arte.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.080
Guys!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.330
We haven't seen you around
our workshop recently.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.450
Are you not coming anymore?

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:01.370
Once I finish the new piece
I'm doing, I'll go over again!

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.250
Hey!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:08.500
After this, the masters need to talk,
so they said to wait at your workshops!

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.620
--What?!
--Huh?!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.790
A girl? What are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.660
Um, I'm...

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.870
This has nothing to do with outsiders.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.790
Outsider? I'm not--

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.040
She's an apprentice, the same as us.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:28.910
What? No way! A girl--

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.330
Wait, are you...?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.910
Are you the female apprentice at Master Leo's
that everyone's been talking about?

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.580
Yes, I am.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:39.040
Oh? So you're an apprentice, huh?

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.870
One girl among so many men
will get you weird looks,

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:49.500
but you should know your place
and stand away from us.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.250
Why are you talking like that?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.830
I was talking to that girl.
It has nothing to do with you.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:57.750
If she's an apprentice, too,
then she's one of us.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.450
So it <i>does</i> have to do with me!

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.790
One of <i>us</i> ?!

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:03.250
Huh? What are you saying?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.830
Now, now, calm down.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.330
You're acting immature. Just calm down--

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:12.250
What the hell? Are you trying
to make a pass at that girl?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.540
Huh?!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.580
You wanna fight, bastard?
Saying something so stupid!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:22.120
You all are the ones being stupid!
It's weirder to be hanging out with a girl!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.870
Huh? Wait!

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:28.870
If you're a man of Florence,
then let's decide it with <i>this</i> !

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.910
Bring it on!

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.040
Let's go!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.080
I'll crush you!

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:44.330
Wh-What should I do...? Is this my fault...?

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:47.580
No, I don't think it's your fault, Arte.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.950
Everyone, please stop!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:50.700
Arte!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.080
Everyone!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.120
Stop fighting! Stop!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.080
Arte, look out!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.200
Huh?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.000
Arte!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:07.200
Hey, boys! You're in front of a church!

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.660
Owwwww...!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:13.080
You fractious boys who do not fear God
are causing public disorder!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.040
Hm?

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:18.540
You even got a girl caught up in this
and injured her? You hooligan!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.500
Ouch!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.660
This is why girls are...

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:28.910
Oh, I'm so pathetic.
I can't believe I passed out.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:33.120
Are you all right, Arte?
You should lie down a little longer.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.450
No, I'm fine. Sorry to cause you trouble.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.700
Besides, the masters will be
going home soon, too, right?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:43.120
I need to get back. Thanks! See you later!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.750
Arte!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:48.410
I'm sure everyone will
accept you sooner or later.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.700
Thanks. I'll do my best to make that happen!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:59.290
Recently, there have been less absences
at this guild leaders' meeting, too.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.540
Is this also thanks to the slump?
It's not a good thing.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.410
Now, shall we get down to business?

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:08.200
Has anything changed recently?

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.700
Oh, Leo took on a female apprentice, right?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:15.660
During the funeral, that caused
a bit of a ruckus, didn't it?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.500
It doesn't seem to be that big of a deal,
but since we're in a slump,

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:27.910
we can't just ignore someone who would
cause friction among the apprentices.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.750
Welcome back, Leo.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:35.160
What's the matter? Why did you have
to go out suddenly this morning?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.370
I was summoned by the guild leaders.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.330
Oh, did you go shopping?

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.870
If you had an errand, I could've gone.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.370
Leo?

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.620
Arte, do you have any experience
painting frescoes?

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:50.580
Painting frescoes...?

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.790
You mean painting murals on plaster?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:53.580
Yeah.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:08:00.290
Yes, I do... but only on small
stone slabs about this big.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.000
So you know generally how to do it, then.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.540
Huh? Yes, more or less...

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.000
Here are some tools.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.540
Try plastering the area I just marked off.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.450
Huh?

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:14.410
Hurry up!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.160
Right!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:20.540
Um, let's see... I think... I have
to mix the lime and water,

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.950
and then adjust their quantities
based on the level of moisture...

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:25.750
C-Calm down, me!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.750
I-I'm done.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:44.950
Right. First off, the concentration
of the plaster is terrible.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.660
It'll crack later.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.450
Also, the surface isn't smooth,
so brushes will get caught on it.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:56.700
You went outside the area I marked off,
and you were too slow. That's crucial.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:01.120
If it dries before colors are painted on,
then you have to start all over.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:05.020
"Doom"

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:05.160
I'm sorry. Um... Basically,
it's pretty much all bad, right?

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.620
Yeah, looks like it.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.910
But, well, now I know what you need to work on.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:10.660
Work on?

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:15.620
Okay, Arte. Practice plastering
for the next ten days.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.950
Huh? Did you take on a fresco job?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.370
No, not us.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:25.120
There have been some objections about
me taking you on as an apprentice.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.250
Huh?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.750
This is the condition they gave for you
continuing your training as a painter.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:37.250
Man, ten days passed so fast.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:41.830
Listen, your job this time is to help with
the decorative paintings for this grand hall.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:47.750
Imagine that all the masters and apprentices
here are watching how you work.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:52.500
Just because we're in front of the guild leaders
doesn't mean I'm going to treat you differently.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.000
I'm just going to do my work.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.620
Arte!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.250
You were called in for this, too?

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.000
Yes!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.000
I'm glad I know someone here.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.580
Oh, good. I'm glad, too!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:08.330
But... it looks like not
everyone's gonna be glad.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.040
That apprentice...

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.750
You're that girl from the other day!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:17.500
Okay, everyone, listen up!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:20.290
I had you all gather today to see
who you would be working with.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:24.910
You're all here working for me,
so I'll have you do things my way.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.870
Make sure you don't cause any
trouble while you're working here.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.290
Damn it.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.830
Did you hear the rumors from Rome?

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:41.000
Yeah, it sounds like the current pope
is investing a lot in the arts.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.660
Thanks to that, the center of the arts
has moved from Florence to Rome,

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.620
and we just keep getting less work.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.950
At this rate, even if we have more apprentices,
we can't take care of them all.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:54.040
Leo should get rid of that girl and
take one or two at his place, too.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:59.910
If any apprentices would want to go to
a master who used to be a beggar, that is.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:01.660
Seriously.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.500
Nice to meet you, um, I'm...

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:15.160
Nice to meet you, I'm Arte. Um...

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.620
Arte, don't worry about it.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:23.500
Nice to meet you! My name is Arte!

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:27.040
I look forward to working with you all!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.000
N-Nice to meet you...

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.080
Oh, this is good.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:39.200
You weren't timid at all,
even in that atmosphere.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.410
I'm already used to it!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.910
Used to it? You...

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.910
It's no wonder...

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:55.450
Arte, there's something I want to tell you
about the work starting tomorrow.

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.620
Okay, is everyone ready?

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.160
I've already finished the sketches.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:08.080
Please use the sketches I gave each of you
to work on your individual assignments.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.120
Fresco jobs are tough.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:19.950
Yeah, just carrying the tools
around is heavy labor.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.830
Idiot! What are you doing?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:28.080
It's too uneven! What were you doing
these last ten days? Do it over!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.620
It's 'cause he's using a girl.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.410
She's useless.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.160
Arte...

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:37.120
Go change the water! Hurry!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.160
There's not enough paint!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.160
Yes, sir!

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.700
He's not going easy on her
even though she's a girl.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.540
That'd be hard even for me.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.540
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.080
I'm fine.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.870
This is my job.

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:08.370
But...

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:12.290
...thank you for worrying about me.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:23.370
Even though she has to show
the guild leader her best...

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:30.000
There you are! Arte!

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.790
Are you all right?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:43.870
Yeah, I'm fine now...

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:46.330
Sorry to make you clean up after me.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.620
I was worried since I didn't
see you during the break.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.040
I didn't think you'd be this...

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.580
It's too cruel!

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.790
Making you continue this heavy labor
that would be hard even for a man!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.700
Working you until you threw up
in a place like this!

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:03.120
You should rest after the break, too.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:05.580
I'll go tell Master Leo.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:09.250
Angelo... I'm fine.

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.950
Huh?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.580
Thanks.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.910
So you should focus on your
work as an apprentice, too.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.040
I'm so tired!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:49.580
It'll be constant work starting tomorrow.
Hurry up and eat and go to sleep today.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.910
Are you listening? Hurry up and--

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:15.700
I don't feel rested at all...

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.160
Heavy labor again today, huh?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.580
I wonder if Arte will be okay...

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.750
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:32.290
Arte! Are you okay already?
You threw up like that yesterday... too...

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.620
L-Looks like you're fine.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:41.080
Oh, I missed eating dinner yesterday!
I need to eat a lot and do my best today, too!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.950
Please move!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.870
Excuse me, coming through!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:48.370
You didn't make enough paint!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.540
Yes, sir! I'll make more right away!

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:51.580
Go change the water!

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:52.870
Yes, sir!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:53.830
And clean up!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.370
Yes, sir!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.830
You're too slow! Don't dawdle!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:57.700
Yes, sir!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.040
Seems tough, as usual.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.910
She's doing a good job.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.040
Look!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.870
Hey, that girl...

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:08.620
She's smiling...

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:16.330
Arte, you're so energetic
today, unlike yesterday.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.660
You won't see me looking as disgraceful
as I did yesterday again!

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.120
Wow...!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:39.790
Yesterday, these were still stone
walls with nothing on them...

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:43.160
But that space is slowly
being filled with paintings!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:46.000
It's amazing! And fun!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.040
Fun...?

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.620
All right, let's do this!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:57.790
The work is tiring, so I didn't even think
about enjoying this one bit...

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:01.080
She really is strange, huh?

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.040
Okay, break time.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:12.500
I still have some work to do,
so go eat by yourself.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:15.620
Okay, I'll go first, then.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:23.200
Now... it looks like we can do
a little more today...

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.700
Guild Leader Aroldo!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.000
Just call me Aroldo.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:37.830
I thought a female apprentice
would be hard to handle,

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.540
but she's obedient and hardworking.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:44.330
I'd like my impertinent apprentices
to learn from her.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:48.080
Besides, that girl is good.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.160
She's a lot like you.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:54.620
You were also looked down upon
and looked at with strange eyes

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:57.580
by those around you because
of your birth, right?

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:00.660
But you overcame those adverse
conditions and moved forward.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.500
That's not... I...

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:08.870
No matter how painful or hard it is,
your apprentice believes in you

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:13.000
and does what you say obediently,
trying her best to keep up.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.330
Who can resist an apprentice like that?

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.910
It made me think I should look
for a female apprentice, too.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.160
Master Aroldo.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.750
Hm?

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:27.910
Will you put in a good word for her
with the other leaders?

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.830
Sure. That's what I was planning to do.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:44.040
What's the matter, Angelo?
Let's hurry up and get home.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.830
Leo's workshop is still there, right?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.790
They're working really hard, huh?

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:52.750
The guys from the other guilds were surprised
by how hard Arte was working.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.250
Yeah...

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.830
That's it for today. Let's clean up.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.700
Y-Yes, sir...

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:11.700
G-Got it...

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:13.750
You--

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.910
Hey, what's wrong?

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:21.000
You used up your strength?
Don't scare me like that...

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.330
Hey, wake up! Hey!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.080
Jeez...

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:28.700
No matter how hard it is,

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:32.330
your apprentice believes in you,
trying her best to keep up.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.700
Who can resist an apprentice like that?

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:43.200
Turn, turn! Don't let them stop you!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.120
Those guys sure are energetic.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:49.700
They're almost done, and they
don't have much work left.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.200
I'm nowhere near done, though.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.580
Hey, you lot!

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:59.250
I know you're on break, but don't go overboard!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:03.000
S-Sorry. We'll make sure no one gets hurt.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.410
Um, excuse me!

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:08.200
A-Arte?

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:13.870
Um, can I... can I play <i>calcio</i>
with you guys, too?

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.370
What?

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:26.700
Come on.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:30.000
We won't go easy on you
just because you're a girl.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.290
Okay!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.120
Thank you!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.750
I see...

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:42.450
I said she was similar to Leo yesterday,
but she might be better than him.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:55.500
The flowering capital, Florence, huh?
A beautiful city, as usual.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.120
Good thing we arrived before the sun set.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:04.080
Let's hurry over. I'm sure they'll
be happy to see you, Lord Yuri.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:07.160
Oh, my, if it isn't Yuri Falier!

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.870
You've come such a long way
from Venice! Welcome!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:16.330
It was so sudden, I was surprised.
You must be tired from your long journey.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:19.410
Oh, it was a nice journey.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:23.830
At any rate, you're building
a magnificent palace here.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.450
I'm honored by your words.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:29.500
Oh? This looks like it will
become a wonderful hall.

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.080
I'm looking forward to seeing it finished.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.540
The ceiling is being made
through a different order,

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.910
and the plan is to put the
completed work in afterwards.

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.660
That's making me even more excited to see it.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:45.450
Hm? Sketches?

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:51.250
Those are practice drawings done by the
apprentices before the plaster is painted

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.410
with permission from their masters.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:57.830
Oh? So they're drawings by future masters, then.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:02.200
Those hand sketches...

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:05.250
The soft expression in those hands is wonderful.

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:09.450
Most of the others are rough and hard.

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:11.660
Only those are different.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:14.500
Oh, those were drawn by the female apprentice.

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:16.000
Female apprentice?

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.160
Yes. Unusual, isn't it?

00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:22.700
Oh? How interesting.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:59.370
"Preview"

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:00.450
The people of Venice seem so refined!

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:04.660
Future female painter, why don't you
also try living a more elegant life?

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:04.790
"The Venetian Noble"

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:10.970
"The Venetian Noble"

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:07.160
Next time, "The Venetian Noble."

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:10.910
I'm also a scrap of a noble, though!
